Embedded Files

[# Only the imported @denotest/different-nested-dep package and its]
[# dependency are embedded from the local node_modules directory —]
[# @denotest/subtract is installed but never imported. The hoisted]
[# fallback symlinks for the kept packages are embedded too, so]
[# undeclared requires keep resolving at runtime.]
[WILDLINE]
├── main.ts ([WILDLINE])
└─┬ node_modules ([WILDLINE])
  ├─┬ .deno ([WILDLINE])
  │ ├── @denotest+different-nested-dep-child@[WILDLINE]/node_modules/* ([WILDLINE])
  │ ├── @denotest+different-nested-dep@[WILDLINE]/node_modules/* ([WILDLINE])
  │ └── node_modules/* ([WILDLINE])
  └── @denotest/different-nested-dep --> [WILDLINE]

[WILDCARD]
